{"3674110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LUNA: Obscura", "steam_appid": 3674110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4842070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a lunar base. No memory. No explanation. No way to fight back. Only the hum of failing machines... and something moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Luna: Obscura</i> is a single-player psychological horror experience set in a remote moon base gone silent. With nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight, you must uncover the truth behind the base's eerie emptiness—and your own forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't fight what hunts you—but you can outsmart it. Move quietly, watch its patterns, and use the environment to your advantage: sound travels, and what draws attention away from you might be your only way through. Rushing gets you killed. Being slow is often faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic, escape-room-style puzzles. Avoid unseen threats. And above all... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a small indie team of two—a visual artist and a sound designer—this is a handcrafted descent into isolation, fear, and forgotten memory.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a lunar base. No memory. No explanation. No way to fight back. Only the hum of failing machines... and something moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Luna: Obscura</i> is a single-player psychological horror experience set in a remote moon base gone silent. With nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight, you must uncover the truth behind the base's eerie emptiness—and your own forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't fight what hunts you—but you can outsmart it. Move quietly, watch its patterns, and use the environment to your advantage: sound travels, and what draws attention away from you might be your only way through. Rushing gets you killed. Being slow is often faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve cryptic, escape-room-style puzzles. Avoid unseen threats. And above all... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a small indie team of two—a visual artist and a sound designer—this is a handcrafted descent into isolation, fear, and forgotten memory.</p>", "short_description": "A first-person psychological horror game of hiding, solving, and surviving inside a haunted moon base", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674110/0c433528dd6a4be9c53eac0c30373585a306d612/header.jpg?t=1784812204", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674110/6017de0397bc722d1591e8216935498ae1352b29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784812204", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674110/6017de0397bc722d1591e8216935498ae1352b29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784812204", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended for loading speed and stability</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><b